<view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="muted">售后类型</view>
    <view class="type-row">
      <view class="type {{type === 'refund' ? 'type-on' : ''}}" data-type="refund" bindtap="pickType">仅退款</view>
      <view class="type {{type === 'return' ? 'type-on' : ''}}" data-type="return" bindtap="pickType">退货退款</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="muted">退款原因</view>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{reasons}}" value="{{reasonIndex}}" bindchange="pickReason">
      <view class="picker">{{reasons[reasonIndex]}}</view>
    </picker>
    <view class="muted mt-20">补充说明（选填）</view>
    <textarea class="textarea" value="{{description}}" placeholder="例如：包装破损，薯片碎了大半" bindinput="onDesc" />
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="muted">退款规则</view>
    <view class="rule">零食需未拆封且不影响二次销售；二手书需保证书页完整、无新增涂写。审核通过后金额原路退回余额。</view>
    <view class="rule muted">也可以直接问 AI 助手「我买的这个能退吗」，它会先查政策再帮你提交。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="pd-24">
    <button class="btn-primary" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">提交申请</button>
  </view>
</view>